"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/75940953/bcbdfb070bfdb90e7f24af73a6702da6_5120183192626762667.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">被动技能增加自身攻击虚弱状态敌人时的全伤，主动技能召唤十字架对范围内的敌人持续施加虚弱效果。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">由神恩颂歌使用时可以在战场用来施加虚弱效果，由朔夜观星、暮光骑士·月煌、月下初拥使用时则可以通过敌人的虚弱状态来增加自己的伤害。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">目前主要作为虚弱触发武器在战场使用；虽然能当做输出武器来用，但是不建议这么做。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/75940953/bcbdfb070bfdb90e7f24af73a6702da6_5120183192626762667.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
